     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Hi </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>This is an announcement of the new dartR suit of packages  called dartRverse. </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Due to cran requirements we needed to split our dartr package into several smaller packages. </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>In principle the functionality had not changed and all your code should work as before. </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Therefore after installing the dartRverse and it’s packages nothing should be needed to change. </div>\r\n<div>Just begin your code with library</div>\r\n<div>library(dartRverse)</div>\r\n<div>For detailed instructions see here:</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"display:block\">\r\n<div style=\"display:inline-block\" role=\"link\">\r\n<a style=\"border-radius:10px;font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;display:block;width:300px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://github.com/green-striped-gecko/dartRverse\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"button\" width=\"300\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/green-striped-gecko/dartRverse&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457858361000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Pwcn_rS2hMFU4_nURORgw\">\r\n<table style=\"table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;width:300px;background-color:#e9e9eb;font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"300\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td align=\"center\"><img style=\"width:300px;min-height:150px\" width=\"300\" height=\"150\" alt=\"dartRverse.png\" src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/dartr/attach/390a20570fe1/dartRverse.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\"></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<table bgcolor=\"#E9E9EB\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"300\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;table-layout:fixed;background-color:rgba(233,233,235,1)\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:8px 0px 8px 0px\">\r\n<div style=\"max-width:100%;margin:0px 16px 0px 16px;overflow:hidden\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;font-weight:500;font-size:12px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;text-align:left\">\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://github.com/green-striped-gecko/dartRverse\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/green-striped-gecko/dartRverse&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457858361000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Pwcn_rS2hMFU4_nURORgw\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\">GitHub - green-striped-gecko/dartRverse: dartR - new version - seperating dartR\r\n into specialised packages</font></a></div>\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;font-weight:400;font-size:11px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;text-align:left\">\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://github.com/green-striped-gecko/dartRverse\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/green-striped-gecko/dartRverse&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457858361000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1Pwcn_rS2hMFU4_nURORgw\"><font color=\"#A2A2A9\" style=\"color:rgba(60,60,67,0.6)\">github.com</font></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Please not dartr will only get minor updates in the future but both packages dartR and dartRverse can coexist next to each other. </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>The way how to use both packages next to each other is described here: </div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"display:block\">\r\n<div style=\"display:inline-block\" role=\"link\">\r\n<a style=\"border-radius:10px;font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;display:block;width:300px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none\" rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://green-striped-gecko.github.io/kioloa/\" dir=\"ltr\" role=\"button\" width=\"300\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://green-striped-gecko.github.io/kioloa/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457858361000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hM6pnCA87_8kIlhqSVrZb\">\r\n<table style=\"table-layout:fixed;border-collapse:collapse;width:300px;background-color:#e9e9eb;font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"300\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<table bgcolor=\"#E9E9EB\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"300\" style=\"font-family:-apple-system,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;table-layout:fixed;background-color:rgba(233,233,235,1)\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"padding:8px 0px 8px 0px\">\r\n<div style=\"max-width:100%;margin:0px 16px 0px 16px;overflow:hidden\">\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;font-weight:500;font-size:12px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;text-align:left\">\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://green-striped-gecko.github.io/kioloa/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://green-striped-gecko.github.io/kioloa/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457858361000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hM6pnCA87_8kIlhqSVrZb\"><font color=\"#000000\" style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\">Kioloa PopGen</font></a></div>\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;font-weight:400;font-size:11px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;text-align:left\">\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://green-striped-gecko.github.io/kioloa/\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://green-striped-gecko.github.io/kioloa/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457858361000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hM6pnCA87_8kIlhqSVrZb\"><font color=\"#A2A2A9\" style=\"color:rgba(60,60,67,0.6)\">green-striped-gecko.github.io</font></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"padding:0px 12px 0px 0px\" width=\"36\">\r\n<a rel=\"nofollow\" href=\"https://green-striped-gecko.github.io/kioloa/\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://green-striped-gecko.github.io/kioloa/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457858361000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hM6pnCA87_8kIlhqSVrZb\"><img style=\"display:inline-block;width:36px;min-height:36px\" width=\"36\" height=\"36\"></a></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>(Ignore the hints to  use dev versions as all packages are now on cran)</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>(The site has also code from our recent workshop. )</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>We are also happy to announce a new suit of functions in our new package <b>\r\ndartr.sexlinked</b> created and maintained by Diana and Floriaan, which deals with the identification of sexlinked loci (A more detailed description will follow)</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>As always please post errors and comments here on the google group</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>All the best, </div>\r\n<div>Bernd, Luis, Emily, Arthur, Carlo, Diana and Floriaan &amp; Olly</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">---------\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<u></u>\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11px;background:white;border-collapse:collapse;max-width:630px\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td height=\"45\" width=\"220px\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<a href=\"http://www.canberra.edu.au\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.canberra.edu.au&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792457858361000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1AlinQQOMK5YKmxJiCLFmM\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleu